@TofuShopApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5109

### 商品清單
GET {{TofuShopApi_HostAddress}}/api/menu
Accept: application/json

### 商品詳細資訊與專屬副餐
GET {{TofuShopApi_HostAddress}}/api/menu/dish-1
Accept: application/json

### 查詢不存在的商品
GET {{TofuShopApi_HostAddress}}/api/menu/unknown-dish
Accept: application/json

### 建立日式料理訂單
POST {{TofuShopApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "佐藤健太",
  "phone": "0912345678",
  "diningType": "內用",
  "tableNo": "3號桌",
  "address": "",
  "note": "",
  "items": [
    {
      "dishId": "dish-1",
      "dishName": "特上蒲燒鰻魚飯",
      "customPreferences": "標準飯量",
      "sides": [],
      "quantity": 1,
      "subtotal": 380
    }
  ],
  "totalAmount": 380
}

### 查詢訂單
GET {{TofuShopApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders/ORD-20261016-001
Accept: application/json

### 依預估製作時間同步訂單狀態
PATCH {{TofuShopApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders/ORD-20261016-001/status
Accept: application/json
